    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d640-a2">

                <pb facs="0765" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg645"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign
                            Affairs to Chargé McCreery.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-19"><hi rendition="#italic">October 19,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Chargé d’affaires</hi>: Referring to your note of
                    the 9th instant, relating to the case of the “Mina Grande Mining and Milling
                    Company,” which requests the protection of the Mexican Government with respect
                    to the property it owns near Ures, Sonora, against the assaults of the Yaqui
                    Indians, I have the honor to transmit to you herewith a copy of a note addressed
                    to me by the department of government, informing me that it has already asked
                    the governor of the State of Sonora to furnish, when required, the escorts which
                    the company may request, and to endeavor to give the fullest protection to the
                    persons who have any interests in said state, or who may travel through it.</p>
                <p>On my part, I have asked the department of government to advise this department
                    with respect to any information from the governor of Sonora bearing upon the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
